        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks! `mini.keymap`'s `map_combo` works perfectly. 🙂\n\nAlso switched to `mini.surround` with these keybindings. Ended up with `timeoutlen` set to `200`, which is required to make the `ys`, `ds`, and `cs` bindings work consistently with how fast I usually type them. (Otherwise operating-pending mode will be entered and the `s` key will use the binding from that instead of running `mini.surround` 2 character binding.)\n\nAppreciate all of your hard work on these, @echasnovski!\n\n```lua\n    require(\"mini.surround\").setup({\n      mappings = {\n        add = \"ys\",\n        delete = \"ds\",\n        replace = \"cs\",\n        find = \"gzf\",\n        find_left = \"gzF\",\n        highlight = \"gzh\",\n        update_n_lines = \"gzn\",\n        suffix_last = \"l\",\n        suffix_next = \"n\",\n      },\n      respect_selection_type = true,\n    })\n```",
